title: "MetaCog-C45: A Metacognitive Decision Tree Framework"
abstract: "Scientific machine learning framework extending the C4.5 decision tree algorithm with a dual-process metacognitive layer (System 1 + System 2), integrating Reflection Engine, Decision Core, MetaMemory, and Explainable AI."
